<title>GREECE: GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FALLS TO 12.34 FROM 12.58 PCT.</title>
<headline>GREEK 1M ATHIBOR FALLS TO 12.34 FROM 12.58 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate</p>
<p>(Athibor) for one month fell to 12.34 from 12.58 percent and the</p>
<p>bid rate (Athibid) dropped to 11.76 from 12.02 percent.</p>
